║  Helios POC — End-to-end demo                                  ║
╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

This demo walks through 7 steps:
  1. Validate the setup
  2. Bring up the full stack
  3. Show the tailnet (devices in Tailscale)
  4. Verify the applied policy
  5. Validate RBAC of the simulated EKS cluster
  6. Show the allow/deny matrix (verify.sh)
  7. Clean up / leave it running

Total time: ~5 minutes (with --fast: ~1 minute)

